  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• In a medium saucepan, add the water (for the rice) and bring to the boil.\n• Add basmati rice, stir, cover with a lid and reduce heat to low.\n• Cook for 10 mins, then remove pan from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and the water absorbed, 10 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6971adc8384e652ce6a551cd/step-5cf7e500.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When rice has 10 mins remaining, preheat grill to high.\n• Roughly chop capsicum. Drain sweetcorn. Drain and rinse black beans. Thinly slice spring onion (see ingredients).\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook capsicum, corn and black beans until slightly tender, 3-4 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6971adc8384e652ce6a551cd/step-77db6a10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add tomato paste and All-American spice blend to frying pan and cook until fragrant, 1 min.\n• Stir in the water (for the sauce) and stock powder. Simmer until slightly thickened, 1-2 mins.\n• Remove from heat, then add baby spinach and cooked rice, gently stirring to combine. Season with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6971adc8384e652ce6a551cd/step-80744220.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Transfer rice mixture to a baking dish. Sprinkle with Cheddar cheese.\n• Grill until lightly golden, 6-8 mins.\n• Divide Texan bean and veggie rice bake between plates.\n• Sprinkle with spring onion and serve with the mayonnaise.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6971adc8384e652ce6a551cd/step-dd5c3430.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
